  "contentHtml": "<p>2개의 동영상을 찾았는데 학생들에게 보여주면 도움이 될 거 같아서 소개합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 사춘기에 시냅스를 가지치기 한다는 내용인데 시냅스는 교과서에 나오는 개념이 아니기 때문에 간단하게만 설명하고 넘어갔습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MMd_flPIX6E\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MMd_flPIX6E</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MMd_flPIX6E\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b3A9vb/hySYHlJJAw/qwVNOkeT4LbtkNMxExcK51/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MMd_flPIX6E\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 소뇌의 기능 이상을 간단하게 알아볼 수 있는 방법이라고 합니다. 소뇌의 기능과 관련지어 보여주면 좋을거 같습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bLJkB3YyCmc\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bLJkB3YyCmc</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bLJkB3YyCmc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bJ0zkL/hySYNTOjzn/kn3wHcJdE16m3YsxOa5UKk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=514_104_744_354\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bLJkB3YyCmc\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t